   "title": "Read me",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## ReCaVSR video super-resolution\n\nOne-step streaming diffusion VSR built on Wan2.2 TI2V-5B (USTC). 21 frames, then 8 at a time, each block decoded as it is generated.\n\n**Files** (download into `ComfyUI/models/recavsr/`): [kopper/ReCaVSR](https://huggingface.co/kopper/ReCaVSR) `transformer.safetensors`, `prompt.safetensors`, `flashdecoder.safetensors`.\n\n**Settings**: `scale` 4 is what the model was trained for (2 and 1.5 also documented). `color_fix` wavelet or adain matches colours to the input. `decoder` vae uses ComfyUI's Wan 2.2 VAE instead of the FlashDecoder.\n\nCode: [kopperx/ReCaVSR](https://github.com/kopperx/ReCaVSR), paper [arXiv 2609.37831](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.37831)."
   ],
   "widgets_values_named": {
    "text": "## ReCaVSR video super-resolution\n\nOne-step streaming diffusion VSR built on Wan2.2 TI2V-5B (USTC). 21 frames, then 8 at a time, each block decoded as it is generated.\n\n**Files** (download into `ComfyUI/models/recavsr/`): [kopper/ReCaVSR](https://huggingface.co/kopper/ReCaVSR) `transformer.safetensors`, `prompt.safetensors`, `flashdecoder.safetensors`.\n\n**Settings**: `scale` 4 is what the model was trained for (2 and 1.5 also documented). `color_fix` wavelet or adain matches colours to the input. `decoder` vae uses ComfyUI's Wan 2.2 VAE instead of the FlashDecoder.\n\nCode: [kopperx/ReCaVSR](https://github.com/kopperx/ReCaVSR), paper [arXiv 2609.37831](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.37831)."
   },
   "color": "#432",
